   3.9608817484971333`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f0490303-f8e8-fb42-8c82-\
e6b16d81e500"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["First-hop neighborhood: ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "For each (v, l), get the 8 feature vectors (for each i, l) of dimension ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SuperscriptBox["2", "4"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "2^4", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "73c443b7-deb9-f14d-9f32-6ab8c553fd1b"],
 " = 16 (corresponding to 4 ancilla rotations)."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9608738352809772`*^9, 3.9608738560060825`*^9}, {
  3.9608739718891144`*^9, 3.960874007562275*^9}, {3.9608741293890934`*^9, 
  3.960874130453747*^9}, {3.9608741770133705`*^9, 3.9608741783125095`*^9}, {
